@startuml fig-tcp-header
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title TCP header: fields in wire order (RFC 9293)
note as header
|= Bit offset |= Width (bits) |= Field |
| 0 | 16 | Source Port |
| 16 | 16 | Destination Port |
| 32 | 32 | Sequence Number |
| 64 | 32 | Acknowledgement Number |
| 96 | 4 | Data Offset (32-bit words) |
| 100 | 4 | Reserved (RFC 9293 baseline) |
| 104 | 8 | CWR ECE URG ACK PSH RST SYN FIN |
| 112 | 16 | Window |
| 128 | 16 | Checksum |
| 144 | 16 | Urgent Pointer |
| 160 | 0–320 | Options and padding |

Minimum 20 bytes, maximum 60 bytes.
Sequence numbers count stream bytes, not segments.
Checksum covers TCP header, data and the IP pseudo-header.
end note
@enduml
